WEBVTT

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.792
Yesterday's drama festival was fun, wasn't it?

00:00:11.792 --> 00:00:13.958
Sugino gave a really
enthusiastic performance, huh?

00:00:13.958 --> 00:00:16.833
I didn't know he could make such an evil face.

00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:20.917
I tried too hard thinking about
co-starring with Kanzaki.

00:00:20.917 --> 00:00:24.083
She probably hates me after
seeing my face like that, though.

00:00:24.083 --> 00:00:26.083
That's not true, Sugino.

00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:29.250
I thought it was really cool that you could act.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:33.417
Seriously? Maybe I'll quit baseball
and become an actor!

00:00:33.417 --> 00:00:36.625
Pitchers need to be able to act, too.

00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:40.500
I'm happy to see my students
show unexpected talents.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.167
<i>You're all I think about</i>

00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:04.000
<i>Starting not to see anything else</i>

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.417
<i>I'll win your heart for sure--I swear</i>

00:01:09.417 --> 00:01:12.125
<i>Me, not cool? Oh, that old tale</i>

00:01:12.125 --> 00:01:14.833
<i>I've spared no effort since then</i>

00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:18.625
<i>Should be over my problems by now</i>

00:01:18.625 --> 00:01:22.625
<i>I'm brimming with confidence: I can do it</i>

00:01:22.625 --> 00:01:25.583
<i>And just when I get warmed up</i>

00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:30.792
<i>Yeah, I get knocked down like this every time</i>

00:01:30.792 --> 00:01:36.375
<i>Your scathing, serious voice cuts me</i>

00:01:36.375 --> 00:01:41.792
<i>Thousands, tens of thousands</i>
<i>of times I've given form to my feelings</i>

00:01:41.792 --> 00:01:47.292
<i>Driven them in,</i>
<i>thrown them in--but all you do is run</i>

00:01:47.292 --> 00:01:49.917
<i>Question, question: what</i>

00:01:49.917 --> 00:01:52.625
<i>Question, question: on earth</i>

00:01:52.625 --> 00:01:55.417
<i>Question, question: did I</i>

00:01:55.417 --> 00:01:58.000
<i>Ever know about you anyway?</i>

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.708
<i>Question, question: why</i>

00:02:00.708 --> 00:02:03.417
<i>Question, question: is it</i>

00:02:03.417 --> 00:02:06.250
<i>Question, question: you are</i>

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:11.208
<i>So close and yet so far away?</i>

00:02:14.958 --> 00:02:18.958
"14th Period: Secret Identity Time"
"by Sumire Hara"

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:21.458
Oh no...

00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:23.625
Everything fell out
and made a huge mess, huh?

00:02:23.625 --> 00:02:27.333
Yeah, my hand slipped while I was cleaning...

00:02:27.333 --> 00:02:29.917
These are the beads we used
for the river in the play.

00:02:29.917 --> 00:02:32.542
We borrowed them from a prop company.

00:02:32.542 --> 00:02:34.833
It's fine. Let's pick them up together.

00:02:34.833 --> 00:02:36.917
Thanks!

00:02:36.917 --> 00:02:40.667
I didn't want to get in the way
of everyone making assassination plans.

00:02:40.667 --> 00:02:45.333
I see. So this is why you stepped out.

00:02:46.583 --> 00:02:49.042
I'll help you, too.

00:02:49.042 --> 00:02:51.500
Can we count on you, then?

00:02:54.583 --> 00:02:57.042
His back is completely defenseless.

00:02:57.042 --> 00:03:00.792
But if we could get him under these conditions,

00:03:00.792 --> 00:03:03.750
we wouldn't have had to
work so hard this past year.

00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:06.583
Something smells fishy.

00:03:06.583 --> 00:03:10.750
Oh, during the school festival,
we smoked food here.

00:03:13.042 --> 00:03:15.375
We had a lot of different school events, huh?

00:03:15.375 --> 00:03:20.542
Yeah. But once we
clean this up, they'll all be over.

00:03:20.542 --> 00:03:22.833
It really brings back memories.

00:03:22.833 --> 00:03:26.000
Like when Koro Sensei
first came to the E Class...

00:03:27.833 --> 00:03:30.500
Back then, you kids
were complete amateurs, huh?

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:33.083
I failed at the beginning.

00:03:33.083 --> 00:03:34.833
And Sugino couldn't do it, either.

00:03:34.833 --> 00:03:38.083
After that, Karma came, and he
didn't know much about Koro Sensei,

00:03:38.083 --> 00:03:40.375
so he asked you, right, Nagisa?

00:03:40.375 --> 00:03:42.958
I got really impatient when Itona came along...

00:03:42.958 --> 00:03:45.542
I thought Itona'd get him first.

00:03:48.708 --> 00:03:52.750
Okajima hid something like this again?

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:58.000
I got to do a lot of different things
in this classroom, too.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.333
It's fun, but a little depressing.

00:04:00.333 --> 00:04:02.458
I'm a terrible swimmer.

00:04:02.458 --> 00:04:06.250
Once I put my mind to something,
I just keep on rolling.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:10.833
Not even your closest friends
get to see your true blade.

00:04:12.458 --> 00:04:15.750
I'll keep trying to kill you.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:19.542
With a jiggly blade.

00:04:19.542 --> 00:04:22.333
I have others, too, you know.

00:04:38.542 --> 00:04:40.708
You didn't notice, did you?

00:04:40.708 --> 00:04:42.375
Not this whole time.

00:04:46.875 --> 00:04:48.458
A pitfall?

00:04:49.917 --> 00:04:53.167
I love you, Koro Sensei.

00:04:54.583 --> 00:04:56.042
Please die.

00:04:58.875 --> 00:05:01.208
Kayano...

00:05:01.208 --> 00:05:03.500
I was always watching.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:06.958
Different assassins tried and failed.

00:05:06.958 --> 00:05:11.083
The most effective of
what they used was a simple pitfall!

00:05:15.042 --> 00:05:17.542
An anti-me pool!

00:05:17.542 --> 00:05:20.833
I have to... get above ground... quickly...!

00:05:20.833 --> 00:05:22.625
I'm good, aren't I?

00:05:22.625 --> 00:05:29.750
I studied the pattern of your tentacles
from the best seat in the house for a year!

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.542
One more attack!

00:05:39.708 --> 00:05:41.125
Oh, no!

00:05:52.333 --> 00:05:53.708
Koro Sensei!

00:05:53.708 --> 00:05:56.083
What in the world was that just now?

00:06:06.042 --> 00:06:08.583
Kayano...?

00:06:08.583 --> 00:06:11.375
What's with those tentacles?

00:06:11.375 --> 00:06:14.917
Aw man, I attacked with all I had, too.

00:06:14.917 --> 00:06:19.292
I can't believe I let him get away.
I must have underestimated him.

00:06:19.292 --> 00:06:22.500
Kayano, what in the world...?

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:26.917
Sorry, Kaede Kayano's not my real name.

00:06:26.917 --> 00:06:29.208
I'm Aguri Yukimura's little sister.

00:06:30.333 --> 00:06:32.542
You understand now, don't you?

00:06:32.542 --> 00:06:34.625
Murderer.

00:06:34.625 --> 00:06:36.458
Yukimura...

00:06:38.625 --> 00:06:41.792
Kayano's face after she stopped acting

00:06:41.792 --> 00:06:45.292
looked cruel, as if it
belonged to someone else.

00:06:46.417 --> 00:06:48.750
It's no use crying over spilt milk.

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:50.958
I have to reset.

00:06:50.958 --> 00:06:53.667
I'll try to kill you
again tomorrow, Koro Sensei.

00:06:53.667 --> 00:06:56.625
I'll let you know where beforehand.

00:06:56.625 --> 00:07:01.292
Now that I've fought you
tentacle-to-tentacle, I know for sure.

00:07:01.292 --> 00:07:04.958
I can definitely kill you as I am right now.

00:07:17.042 --> 00:07:19.167
Unthinkable.

00:07:19.167 --> 00:07:21.958
If she grew tentacles without any maintenance,

00:07:21.958 --> 00:07:24.875
she would have been
under constant hellish pain.

00:07:24.875 --> 00:07:28.792
There's no way she could bear it
without having it show on her face.

00:07:28.792 --> 00:07:32.583
Not only that, but she's
Aguri Yukimura's little sister?

00:07:32.583 --> 00:07:35.250
Isn't that our old homeroom teacher?

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:39.667
I thought I'd seen Kayano before somewhere.

00:07:39.667 --> 00:07:44.000
I remembered after seeing her with
her hair down and her harsher expression.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.583
Do you remember Haruna Mase?

00:07:46.583 --> 00:07:50.458
The young acting prodigy
who could easily take on any role.

00:07:50.458 --> 00:07:53.000
It's been a while since she
left the entertainment business,

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:57.208
and her hair and personality are
completely different, so I didn't notice...

00:08:00.958 --> 00:08:04.500
Which is the real her?

00:08:08.042 --> 00:08:12.667
When I first entered
the classroom, I was surprised.

00:08:12.667 --> 00:08:16.708
There was someone
completely unexpected in there.

00:08:16.708 --> 00:08:22.292
Aguri Yukimura's little sister--
real name: Akari Yukimura.

00:08:22.292 --> 00:08:26.333
She had infiltrated
that classroom using a false name.

00:08:26.333 --> 00:08:29.542
After I realized who she was
and investigated her private life,

00:08:29.542 --> 00:08:33.917
as I expected, she was hiding tentacles.

00:08:33.917 --> 00:08:38.083
She understood how the tentacles worked
and how to use them in a short amount of time,

00:08:38.083 --> 00:08:41.250
so she must have great intellect,

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:45.208
but what is even more
miraculous is her tenacity.

00:08:45.208 --> 00:08:49.042
She didn't break a sweat at
the maddening pain from the tentacles,

00:08:49.042 --> 00:08:53.083
and her mental fortitude
allowed her to keep smiling for a year.

00:08:54.208 --> 00:08:56.958
She put on different faces
for different occasions,

00:08:56.958 --> 00:09:00.875
and used her acting prowess to keep
everyone from noticing her murderous intent.

00:09:02.958 --> 00:09:08.167
Her talent for assassination is head and
shoulders above everyone else in the E Class.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:13.000
"Assassination Classroom, Second Season"
"by Kaede Kayano"

00:09:26.833 --> 00:09:30.125
I was just going to get her.

00:09:30.125 --> 00:09:32.958
We had a lot of catching up to do.

00:09:33.833 --> 00:09:35.542
I was taking an extended
leave of absence from acting

00:09:35.542 --> 00:09:38.583
because of the wishes of my agency.

00:09:38.583 --> 00:09:41.667
People had stopped noticing me around town.

00:09:43.167 --> 00:09:46.292
It's a lot easier now.

00:09:46.292 --> 00:09:49.083
Maybe I should try getting a regular job.

00:10:02.167 --> 00:10:03.583
Sis...

00:10:08.625 --> 00:10:12.917
I was able to crawl in faster than
the adults with my small frame.

00:10:12.917 --> 00:10:15.500
The sight that met my eyes there was...

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:38.375
Sis...

00:10:39.958 --> 00:10:42.542
Sis! Sis!

00:10:42.542 --> 00:10:45.542
Sis! Come on, Sis!

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:03.625
"I will withdraw for now, but I can take over as homeroom teacher
for Kunugigaoka Junior High Class 3-E if you want."

00:11:03.625 --> 00:11:05.208
"I will discuss this with you at a later date."
"From a super-destructive being"

00:11:05.875 --> 00:11:09.667
Next to her, there were vials of liquid.

00:11:09.667 --> 00:11:13.000
I found out later
that they were tentacle seeds.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:17.125
I can't explain why I took one with me.

00:11:17.125 --> 00:11:22.458
But if there was a way to go up against
that monster I had never seen before,

00:11:22.458 --> 00:11:26.208
it had to be in the vial.
I understood that instinctively.

00:11:26.208 --> 00:11:32.417
Human-Tentacle Weapon Prototype.
The type that can be implanted into humans.

00:11:32.417 --> 00:11:40.750
In exchange for great power was
a hellish pain if maintenance was neglected.

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:42.958
I didn't care.

00:11:42.958 --> 00:11:46.083
It was the same as when
I decided to become an actor.

00:11:46.083 --> 00:11:49.708
Once I put my mind
to something, I keep on rolling.

00:11:49.708 --> 00:11:54.375
This is the first time anyone's ever
passed our transfer exam out of the blue...

00:11:54.375 --> 00:11:57.417
Let's see... Kaede Kayano.

00:11:57.417 --> 00:11:59.583
Thank you very much!

00:11:59.583 --> 00:12:01.542
A forged certificate of residence

00:12:01.542 --> 00:12:05.917
and the name of a bit part
I once had in a made-for-TV movie.

00:12:05.917 --> 00:12:09.458
I'll play the part... perfectly...

00:12:09.458 --> 00:12:15.625
By the way, at this school, there's a class
for students with delinquent behaviors--

00:12:18.208 --> 00:12:20.333
--right?

00:12:22.667 --> 00:12:24.542
If things went according to that note,

00:12:24.542 --> 00:12:27.333
the monster that murdered
my sister and ran away

00:12:27.333 --> 00:12:32.250
would definitely come to
Kunugigaoka's Class 3-E.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:34.917
Akari, you're so lucky you're cute.

00:12:34.917 --> 00:12:38.083
I'm jealous that you
got those genes and I didn't.

00:12:38.083 --> 00:12:40.250
I'm jealous of you, too, Sis.

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:44.875
The only thing we have in common
is our black hair, huh?

00:12:44.875 --> 00:12:47.792
I'll change my hair color, too.

00:12:47.792 --> 00:12:53.542
I didn't know why that monster
wanted to take over Sis's class.

00:12:53.542 --> 00:12:57.708
But there was only one thing
I could do as her little sister--

00:12:59.792 --> 00:13:02.250
In order to prevent
my revenge from being exposed,

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:04.042
I had to stay completely in character.

00:13:06.167 --> 00:13:09.333
Oh, you must be...

00:13:09.333 --> 00:13:12.208
Yup, I transferred here today.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.750
Your hair sure is long.

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:22.750
Oh, I want to cut it short,
but there are reasons why I can't...

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:25.625
Whether I stand out or not, I'll be watched.

00:13:25.625 --> 00:13:28.417
That's why I have to
play around with the casting.

00:13:28.417 --> 00:13:31.167
To create a main character
who stands out more than me,

00:13:31.167 --> 00:13:34.292
and devote myself to being a side character.

00:13:34.292 --> 00:13:37.167
Look, you're the same as me now!

00:13:37.167 --> 00:13:40.417
I'm Kaede Kayano. Nice to meet you!

00:13:42.167 --> 00:13:44.875
The tentacles asked me

00:13:44.875 --> 00:13:48.417
what I wanted to become...

00:13:48.417 --> 00:13:50.833
I answered...

00:13:50.833 --> 00:13:53.375
I want to be an assassin.

00:13:53.375 --> 00:13:57.500
I stifled my resentment and
intense pain--all my true feelings.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:00.917
An assassin playing my part
until I carried out my plan.

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:07.875
I don't care if I die.

00:14:07.875 --> 00:14:10.625
As long as I get my revenge.

00:14:10.625 --> 00:14:15.042
As I thought. You don't follow directions.

00:14:15.042 --> 00:14:20.583
I even warned you to wait
until my preparations were complete.

00:14:20.583 --> 00:14:23.167
What do you think <i>you </i>can do?

00:14:23.167 --> 00:14:27.042
You couldn't even take care
of Itona and abandoned him.

00:14:27.042 --> 00:14:32.167
From the looks of it,
your metabolic balance is off, as well.

00:14:32.167 --> 00:14:35.833
The fate of one who continues
to use untamed tentacles...

00:14:37.667 --> 00:14:39.708
Mind your own business.

00:14:39.708 --> 00:14:43.125
I'm going to kill him by myself.
Don't get in my way.

00:14:47.292 --> 00:14:49.750
Don't be so cold

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:52.833
to your only big brother...

00:14:54.958 --> 00:14:56.375
I'll kill you!

00:14:56.375 --> 00:14:58.167
A brute like you!

00:14:58.167 --> 00:15:01.917
Now that you mention it,
that's definitely Kayano.

00:15:01.917 --> 00:15:05.875
Wow, her expression and personality
are completely different.

00:15:05.875 --> 00:15:09.792
No wonder she was able to
hide her identity for almost a year.

00:15:09.792 --> 00:15:12.625
Kayano was friends with everyone,

00:15:12.625 --> 00:15:15.917
but she never let anyone get too close.

00:15:15.917 --> 00:15:22.583
She stayed close to me because she was
using my murderous intent to hide her own.

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:23.667
"My Plan (Secret)"

00:15:23.667 --> 00:15:27.625
Now that I think about it, the giant
pudding was a dummy assassination, too.

00:15:27.625 --> 00:15:31.583
Because in this class, it would be
suspicious if she didn't try anything.

00:15:33.042 --> 00:15:35.000
She was acting...

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:40.458
...as the cheerful, fun, and almost
completely harmless Kaede Kayano.

00:15:40.458 --> 00:15:48.042
Koro Sensei, Kayano called you a murderer.

00:15:48.042 --> 00:15:51.583
What happened in the past?

00:15:51.583 --> 00:15:57.792
We've built up trust with you for
so long now, so we won't doubt you.

00:15:57.792 --> 00:16:04.125
But you have to tell us about your past.

00:16:04.125 --> 00:16:08.083
If you don't, no one will be able
to accept the current situation.

00:16:08.083 --> 00:16:10.500
That's where we're at right now.

00:16:18.208 --> 00:16:20.125
Very well.

00:16:20.125 --> 00:16:24.208
I'll tell you everything about my past.

00:16:24.208 --> 00:16:29.458
But before that, Kayano is
an important member of the E Class.

00:16:29.458 --> 00:16:33.250
I will tell you when
everyone in the class is together.

00:16:35.792 --> 00:16:39.667
"From: Kaede Kayano" "No Subject" "To Koro Sensei:
Come to the field of zebra grass in the back hills at 7 p.m."

00:16:49.875 --> 00:16:51.708
So you came...

00:16:51.708 --> 00:16:54.500
Then, let's end this.

00:16:57.542 --> 00:17:02.583
Koro Sensei, I'm the one
who gave you your name.

00:17:02.583 --> 00:17:05.417
I'm practically your mother,
so I'll scold you and destroy you.

00:17:05.417 --> 00:17:09.917
Kayano, it is too dangerous
to keep using those tentacles!

00:17:09.917 --> 00:17:13.417
If you do not remove them and get treated
immediately, your life could be in danger!

00:17:13.417 --> 00:17:16.792
What are you talking about?
They're in excellent condition.

00:17:16.792 --> 00:17:19.458
It's no use trying to make me
lose my composure with a bluff.

00:17:19.458 --> 00:17:21.583
Kayano...

00:17:21.583 --> 00:17:23.792
Was it all an act?

00:17:23.792 --> 00:17:30.167
Even when we were having fun?
Or overcoming trials together with everyone?

00:17:30.167 --> 00:17:31.792
It was all an act.

00:17:31.792 --> 00:17:34.625
I <i>am </i>an actor, after all.

00:17:34.625 --> 00:17:37.458
When Nagisa was defeated by Mr. Kataoka,

00:17:37.458 --> 00:17:40.458
I was so irritated,
I wanted to join the fight, too.

00:17:40.458 --> 00:17:44.458
When I was kidnapped by delinquents
and kicked by the Reaper,

00:17:44.458 --> 00:17:47.208
I was so angry, I wanted to kill them.

00:17:47.208 --> 00:17:50.500
But I bore it and acted like a frail girl.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:52.583
Because if my identity
was found out before I killed him,

00:17:52.583 --> 00:17:55.542
I wouldn't be able to avenge my sister.

00:17:55.542 --> 00:17:59.125
Your sister... Miss Yukimura?

00:17:59.125 --> 00:18:03.875
It was so unfortunate that
she was killed by Koro Sensei.

00:18:03.875 --> 00:18:07.042
She loved being a teacher.

00:18:07.042 --> 00:18:10.667
I heard a little about you all, too.

00:18:10.667 --> 00:18:13.500
Come on, you can all do it if you try!

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:18.167
This E Class is a paradise
overflowing with dreams and opportunities!

00:18:18.167 --> 00:18:20.417
Miss Yukimura...

00:18:20.417 --> 00:18:23.167
"Average" "Contemporary Japanese"
Sometimes you wear really lame shirts.

00:18:23.167 --> 00:18:26.750
What? These are my best clothes!

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:30.875
We know, Kayano.

00:18:30.875 --> 00:18:35.042
In March of our second year,
we only had her for two short weeks,

00:18:35.042 --> 00:18:38.167
but she was a very
passionate and good teacher.

00:18:39.042 --> 00:18:43.583
Would Koro Sensei kill
Miss Yukimura just like that?

00:18:43.583 --> 00:18:48.125
He's never done anything
that cruel in front of us before.

00:18:48.125 --> 00:18:53.333
Right? At least hear him out, Kaede.

00:18:53.333 --> 00:18:58.500
He was a teacher who even came all the way
to my house when I was suspended.

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:02.083
But are you really okay with this?

00:19:02.083 --> 00:19:08.958
I can't imagine that what you're doing now
is the best way to solve this as an assassin.

00:19:10.375 --> 00:19:14.083
Your body probably feels hot,
with just the nape of your neck cold.

00:19:14.083 --> 00:19:17.083
It's the abnormal metabolism characteristic
of those with implanted tentacles.

00:19:17.083 --> 00:19:20.208
If you fight in that condition,
you'll really be in trouble.

00:19:20.208 --> 00:19:23.167
You'll lose control
with the heat and intense pain,

00:19:23.167 --> 00:19:26.292
and your life-force will be
sucked out by the tentacles.

00:19:26.292 --> 00:19:28.000
Worst-case...

00:19:30.083 --> 00:19:34.375
Shut up. Outsiders should be quiet.

00:19:34.375 --> 00:19:38.750
No matter the weakness or shortcoming,
if it's polished, it can become a weapon.

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:41.500
You're the one who
taught me that, Koro Sensei.

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:43.667
If my body's so hot I can't bear it,

00:19:43.667 --> 00:19:47.583
then I'll make it even hotter
and gather the heat in my tentacles!

00:19:47.583 --> 00:19:49.292
No! Any more and--!

00:19:53.583 --> 00:19:56.125
I'm in the <i>best </i>condition.

00:19:56.125 --> 00:20:01.458
My whole body's so sensitive that
I won't miss any opening right now.

00:20:01.458 --> 00:20:02.917
Stop it, Kayano!

00:20:02.917 --> 00:20:06.000
This isn't right! I learned, too!

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:11.292
That if you sacrifice yourself to kill someone,
there won't be anything left behind!

00:20:11.292 --> 00:20:15.333
I'm not planning on sacrificing myself, Nagisa.

00:20:15.333 --> 00:20:17.792
I will just...

00:20:17.792 --> 00:20:19.500
...kill this guy.

00:20:21.042 --> 00:20:24.125
Once I put my mind to something,
I just keep on rolling.

00:20:29.167 --> 00:20:30.042
Wow...

00:20:30.042 --> 00:20:32.250
They're like volcanic bombs...

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:37.333
Kayano... She's not acting?
Those are her true feelings?

00:20:38.375 --> 00:20:41.500
I plucked off a piece! It's still moving!

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:44.208
In a mere 10 or 15 seconds of full-out battle,

00:20:44.208 --> 00:20:47.542
her mind is already starting to
be taken over by the tentacles...

00:20:48.833 --> 00:20:51.083
What's the matter, Koro Sensei?

00:20:51.083 --> 00:20:53.208
My head doesn't hurt anymore!

00:20:53.208 --> 00:20:56.000
The pain feels good now!

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:59.167
It's too late if they've already
taken her over that much.

00:20:59.167 --> 00:21:01.583
Whether or not she accomplishes her revenge,

00:21:01.583 --> 00:21:04.875
a few minutes after the end of the battle,

00:21:04.875 --> 00:21:07.250
I think she'll die.

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:08.875
Is this...

00:21:08.875 --> 00:21:13.625
Is this really the assassination
Kayano wanted to carry out?

00:21:13.625 --> 00:21:17.417
Come on! Die, Koro Sensei!

00:21:17.417 --> 00:21:19.708
Kayano...

00:21:19.708 --> 00:21:23.208
Die! Die! Die!

00:21:23.208 --> 00:21:25.625
Die! Die! Die!

00:21:25.625 --> 00:21:28.708
Koro Sensei... Kill me...

00:21:29.875 --> 00:21:31.833
Help me...!

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:48.000
<i>The moon that swims in the night sky</i>

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:53.375
<i>If you stretch out your hand, you can reach it</i>

00:21:53.375 --> 00:21:59.042
<i>I went to touch it: it was warm</i>

00:21:59.042 --> 00:22:04.208
<i>And slowly drew me in</i>

00:22:04.208 --> 00:22:15.583
<i>The multiplying footsteps,</i>
<i>the view from my window:</i>

00:22:15.583 --> 00:22:21.167
<i>As I drifted along, expressionless</i>

00:22:21.167 --> 00:22:25.583
<i>They spilled out of my hands</i>

00:22:25.583 --> 00:22:32.417
<i>It was rocking, swaying--I never knew</i>

00:22:32.417 --> 00:22:37.917
<i>Until I touched it with my own hands</i>

00:22:37.917 --> 00:22:43.417
<i>I'll gather up</i>
<i>and go through all of the things</i>

00:22:43.417 --> 00:23:02.102
<i>Scattered beneath the waning moon</i>
